  "content": [
    {
      "id": "what-is-owwa",
      "title": "What is OWWA?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "The **Overseas Workers Welfare Administration (OWWA)** is a Philippine government agency that provides welfare services and protection programs for Overseas Filipino Workers (OFWs). ([owwa.gov.ph](https://owwa.gov.ph/))"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "OWWA membership gives OFWs access to various benefits and assistance programs including:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "Insurance and healthcare assistance",
            "Livelihood support",
            "Scholarships and training",
            "Repatriation assistance",
            "Calamity assistance",
            "Reintegration programs"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "Qualified members may also apply for the **OWWA e-Card**, an identification and benefits card for active OWWA members."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "what-is-the-owwa-e-card",
      "title": "What is the OWWA e-Card?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "The **OWWA e-Card** is an official identification card issued to active OWWA members. ([owwa.gov.ph](https://owwa.gov.ph/index.php/programs-and-services/owwa-e-card))"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "It may function as:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "OFW identification card",
            "Proof of active OWWA membership",
            "Government transaction ID",
            "Benefits access card"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "Some versions may also support:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "ATM functions",
            "Cashless transactions",
            "Benefits disbursement"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "The card is commonly used for easier verification during OWWA-related transactions."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "who-needs-this",
      "title": "Who Needs This?",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "You may need OWWA membership and an OWWA e-Card if you are:"
        },
        {
          "type": "list",
          "items": [
            "An Overseas Filipino Worker (OFW)",
            "A newly hired overseas worker",
            "Returning overseas worker",
            "Land-based OFW",
            "Sea-based OFW",
            "Applying for OFW assistance programs",
            "Accessing OWWA benefits",
            "Processing overseas employment requirements"
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "content": "OWWA membership is generally linked to active overseas employment status."
        }
      ]
    },
